        "Content": "Four bedroom semi-detached house with adjoining garage in a mature and quiet residential estate.\nWithin easy walking distance of Kells town centre.\nOverlooking a green area.\nIn need of some modernisation, offering an opportunity to create a family home to your own taste.\nSpacious accommodation, large front and rear gardens.\nTarmac driveway with off-street parking.\nExcellent choice of schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, pubs and sporting facilities in Kells.\nEasy access to the M3/M50 for commuting."
